cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Reservoir or its documentation in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Reservoir: an open platform for preserving South African cultural knowledge"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Tshivhinda
    given-names: Kone
    alias: konethegreat
repository-code: "https://github.com/konethegreat/reservoir"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - cultural heritage
  - indigenous knowledge
  - ethnobotany
  - South Africa
  - African languages
  - plant identification
  - language preservation
abstract: >-
  Reservoir is a free, open, community-grown platform and mobile app for preserving
  and sharing South African cultural knowledge: plants and their traditional uses,
  food, practices and languages, with community-controlled consent and a mission-native AI.
